Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 23:08:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] reaper shell: shell-owned tab bar, page-level scroll (no rail
 scrollbar), title visibility, R_ current_url fix

Tabs move into shell chrome (renderTabs from menuTree; in-page #tabMenu hidden - stock renderer throws on R_ pages via current_url mismatch at state.js menuList[-1]). Scroll model: body scrolls, topbar+stage sticky, rail has no own scrollbar (user request). reaper_content.css force-visibles .formfonttitle/.formfontdesc. R_ pilots bake current_url R_-strip for page-internal name matching.
